        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    spot_price = 50\n    risk_free_rate = 0.04\n    time_to_maturity = 3 / 12\n    value_of_advantages = 5\n    value_of_disadvantages = 6\n\n    # Adjust the spot price for advantages and disadvantages, then compound annually\n    net_spot_value = spot_price + value_of_advantages - value_of_disadvantages\n    forward_price = net_spot_value * (1 + risk_free_rate) ** time_to_maturity\n\n    # Return the forward price rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(forward_price, 3)\n```",
